# ACL example — read-only tap-stream, write Pi publishers.
# user tap-pi
# topic write tap/milo/#
# topic write cam/milo/#
#
# user tap-stream
# topic read tap/+/session
# topic read tap/+/video_overlay
# topic read tap/+/accel/batch
#
# user tap-collector
# topic read tap/#
# topic read duet/#
# topic read cam/#
# topic read print/#
